{"id":1001,"date":"2025-03-27T12:01:53","date_gmt":"2025-03-27T12:01:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/?p=1001"},"modified":"2025-04-11T12:53:56","modified_gmt":"2025-04-11T12:53:56","slug":"visita-de-la-directora-de-gestion-ambiental-municipal-lic-angelica-merlino","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/visita-de-la-directora-de-gestion-ambiental-municipal-lic-angelica-merlino\/","title":{"rendered":"Visita de la Directora de Gesti\u00f3n Ambiental Municipal Lic. Ang\u00e9lica Merlino"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Estudiantes de 2\u00b0 a\u00f1o de la Tec. Sup. en Servicios Gastron\u00f3micos junto a la Prof. Italia Fabiano, participaron de un encuentro con la Directora de Gesti\u00f3n Ambiental Municipal Lic. Ang\u00e9lica Merlino.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Se abordaron temas sobre la gesti\u00f3n de residuos en el sector gastron\u00f3mico, incluyendo la correcta clasificaci\u00f3n y separaci\u00f3n, estrategias para reducir el desperdicio, la importancia del compostaje y el cumplimiento de normativas ambientales en establecimientos gastron\u00f3micos.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2.webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-1024x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1004\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-70x70.webp 70w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-246x246.webp 246w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-276x276.webp 276w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2-125x125.webp 125w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental2.webp 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:41px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Agradecemos la visita de la Lic. Merlino que permiti\u00f3 a los estudiantes conocer los desaf\u00edos que enfrenta la gesti\u00f3n ambiental en el rubro, brind\u00e1ndoles acciones clave para aplicar en su futuro laboral profesional.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4.webp\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4-1024x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1003\" srcset=\"https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4-768x768.webp 768w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4-70x70.webp 70w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/visitaGestionAmbiental4-246x246.webp 246w, https:\/\/iseta.edu.ar\/iseta\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/v